WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.594
- Hey, I'm Tan
("Habanera" by Georges Bizet)

00:00:01.594 --> 00:00:03.835
and I'm obsessed with
other people's obsessions.

00:00:03.835 --> 00:00:07.752
- My name is Lynea and
I am obsessed with cats.

00:00:08.768 --> 00:00:11.412
I only had four cats
when I moved out here.

00:00:11.412 --> 00:00:16.039
Currently we have about 700
adults and about 300 kittens.

00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:18.900
I say I'm eccentric slash masochistic.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.471
Okay, that's your's

00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:21.878
It sounds better than crazy.

00:00:21.878 --> 00:00:23.213
(guns blasting)

