(Lynea yells)

00:00:24.486 --> 00:00:26.448
- Next we're gonna go
look for coyote skulls.

00:00:26.448 --> 00:00:27.358
- Alright.

00:00:27.358 --> 00:00:29.752
- [Lynea] I don't know people
dismember human beings.

00:00:29.752 --> 00:00:31.435
That'd be so gross.

00:00:31.435 --> 00:00:32.357
(phone rings)

00:00:32.357 --> 00:00:33.842
- Cat House on the Kings,
Cat House on the Kings.

00:00:33.842 --> 00:00:36.425
(cats meowing)

00:00:40.692 --> 00:00:42.278
- [Tania] I like cats, a shitload.

00:00:42.278 --> 00:00:43.673
I love cats.

00:00:43.673 --> 00:00:45.068
You know my first word was cat.

00:00:45.068 --> 00:00:46.986
All the VHS family videos are of me

00:00:46.986 --> 00:00:49.770
flicking through books,
giggling at pictures of them.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:50.880
It's embarrassing.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.674
- [Man] Tell us your story, Tania.

00:00:52.674 --> 00:00:53.859
- [Tania Voiceover]
But then there's Lynea,

00:00:53.859 --> 00:00:55.714
cat lord at Cat House on the Kings.

00:00:55.714 --> 00:00:58.202
She has over 1,000 feral felines.

00:00:58.202 --> 00:00:59.556
Ya, 1,000.

00:00:59.556 --> 00:01:01.937
And is said to have
given and literally given

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:04.186
