00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:53.680
These are the anti-socials, the wilds,

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:56.805
the don't touch me and I
won't touch you kittens.

00:03:56.805 --> 00:03:57.730
- [Tania] This is where I belong.

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.028
It's kind of like the Blair Witch.

00:03:59.028 --> 00:04:00.561
Have you always loved cats?

00:04:00.561 --> 00:04:02.140
- Yes, and my mom
wouldn't let me have one.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.076
Look at me now.

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:03.958
Fixed her, didn't I?

00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:06.092
But I think I went a little overboard.

00:04:06.092 --> 00:04:06.976
