1,300 pounds of dry food,

00:04:14.236 --> 00:04:17.061
1,000 cans of wet food,
600 pounds of litter,

00:04:17.061 --> 00:04:20.138
60 rolls of paper towels, nine
gallons of laundry detergent,

00:04:20.138 --> 00:04:23.996
